  m_text: The Answer is a narrative-driven experience that places players in a world
    shaped by decisions and discovery. Every choice feels meaningful, guiding the
    story through moments of reflection, mystery, and connection. Built with care
    and creativity, the game blends immersive atmosphere with character-driven storytelling
    to draw players into its journey. The Answer invites you to explore, decide,
    and uncover what lies beyond, offering an experience that resonates with curiosity
    and emotion.
